{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "係嗰啲……去嗰邊嘅安排呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "嗯，手續有人跟緊，我唔急。急嗰啲人先會亂，我想每一樣都清清楚楚先行。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你真係好定，換著我，實瞓唔著。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_think.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "後生仔，臨記企位企到咁後做咩？眼神唔好死望地下，你望邊，鏡頭就知你諗緊邊。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_serious.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "記住，冇台詞嗰個，唔代表可以冇反應。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "而家啲人成日話邊個邊個係天才，一出道就識演。我聽到就想笑。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "冇天才呢回事呀？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chung_choning_angry.webp", "name": "鍾楚凝", "line": "有天份冇用功，一樣企唔穩。演技係磨出嚟㗎，唔係跌落嚟㗎。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chung_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_serious.webp", "R": "chung_choning_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "磨到幾時先算夠？我會記住慢慢磨。", "choices": []}
