{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "阿偉，你嚟得啱喇，我呢首新歌爭一段和音，錄音師嗌我自己諗辦法。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "和音？我冇正經唱過歌㗎喎家聲哥。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_smile.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "唔使你唱到幾勁，嗰段得幾句，你把聲夠實淨就得，我聽過你喺片場哼歌㗎。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你真係聽過？我以為冇人留意添。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "我對聲好敏感㗎，邊個唱歌有心，邊個唱歌交差，我一聽就知。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "點呀，試唔試？你唔試，我唔逼你，但機會唔係日日有㗎。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_base.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "……", "choices": ["試，一Take過畀你睇", "老實話自己未夠班，唔好搞砸"]}
{"phase": "e_lok_beats", "attempt": 3, "step": 11, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "lok_gasing_serious.webp", "name": "駱家聲", "line": "肯認未夠班，好過夾硬嚟搞砸首歌。你企埋嚟聽住先，學下先，下次先試。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 0, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "阿偉，企埋嚟啦，出面落到狗屎咁。飲杯茶先，凍到手都震，點寫更紙呀我。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_serious.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "芬姐"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_serious.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "芬姐，你嗰本更紙先至係寶嚟，成個廠邊個開工邊個收工，都喺你嗰幾版紙入面。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "做"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "做咗十幾年副導演喇，咩人未見過。啲後生入嚟嗰陣個個都話要紅，我就睇佢哋捱唔捱到第三年。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_serious.webp", "line": "你唔同，你肯做啲冇"}
